<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορδῐν-άομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορδῐν-έομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretch one's
				limbs, yawn, gape</i>, properly of men or dogs half roused from
			sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Superf.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.168
			</span></i>; hence also of a person tired or bored, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στένω, κέχηνα, σκορδινῶμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. καὶ δυσφορεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					922
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				642
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
